error[E0514]: `break` with a value out of a `while` or `for` loop
  --> tests/programs/control/loop_and_labels/e0514.la:4:15
  |
4 |         break i;
  |               ^
  |
  = help: only `loop` gives a value; a `while` or `for` can end without a `break`

For more about E0514, run `lughac explain E0514`.
